| I1 | 16 optimizer steps per iteration; `spm × grad_accum` = 16; the split comes from a memory smoke ("grad_accum only as needed") | Start at spm 8 / accum 1 on 2 ranks; the smoke may move to 4 / 2 | 3.4, 6.1 |
